# Nested Tsugi checkout only

DJ4E's Tsugi lives at **`dj4e/tsugi/`** (this course tree). It is its own git repo.

`/Users/csev/htdocs/tsugi` (sibling of `dj4e/`, not inside it) is a **different clone**. Do not read, write, grep, migrate, or copy into it while working on DJ4E or `dj4e/tsugi`.

- Edits and `php admin/upgrade.php` stay under `dj4e/tsugi/`.
- CWD-relative `../config.php` from `dj4e/tsugi` loads `dj4e/config.php`, which pulls in **`htdocs/tsugi`**. Use `__DIR__` requires inside Tsugi instead.
- If `dirroot` is not `.../dj4e/tsugi`, stop. Do not follow it to the sibling tree.
